{"id":"165b342192ae9e71","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/542_Solovay_可证性逻辑.md","title":"542 Solovay 可证性逻辑","display":"542_Solovay_可证性逻辑","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号与版本范围\">1. 原始符号与版本范围</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\quad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:k\\to X\\ (Y=\\{e(i):i&lt;k\\})\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{542}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\quad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:k\\to X\\ (Y=\\{e(i):i&lt;k\\})\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{542}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>模态公式构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{box}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{box}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>本条目选取 Solovay 真可证性逻辑 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>（亦称 GLS）的句法版本：内层 GL 定理与外层反射、MP 分开形成。版本来源为 <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2311.00581\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Kurahashi–Takase，定义6.1</a>。下文局部展开全部证明基础，引用不承担定义义务。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{542}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{542}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\">\\(\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\">\\(\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\">\\(\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\">\\(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{box}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\">\\(\\operatorname{box}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>显示记号为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,\\bot,\\neg A,A\\to B,\\Box A\">\\(p,\\bot,\\neg A,A\\to B,\\Box A\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元与替换\">3. 自由变元与替换</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{542}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{542})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{542}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{542})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{542}(p)=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{542}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{542}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{542}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{542}(p)=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{542}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{542}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{542}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{542}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{542}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{542}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{542}(\\Box A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{542}(A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{542}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{542}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{542}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{542}(\\Box A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{542}(A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义。无绑定构造子，故定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{542}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{542})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{542}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{542})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{542}(A)=\\varnothing,\n\\qquad\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,542}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{542}(A)=\\varnothing,\n\\qquad\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,542}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>有限支撑命题替换集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{542}\n=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{542}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}:\n\\{p:\\sigma(p)\\ne p\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{542})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{542}\n=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{542}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}:\n\\{p:\\sigma(p)\\ne p\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{542})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>替换函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{542}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{542}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{542}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{542}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\\)</span> 满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{542}(\\sigma,p)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{542}(\\sigma,\\bot)=\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{542}(\\sigma,p)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{542}(\\sigma,\\bot)=\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{542}(\\sigma,\\neg A)=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}_{542}(\\sigma,A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{542}(\\sigma,\\neg A)=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}_{542}(\\sigma,A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{542}(\\sigma,A\\to B)=\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{542}(\\sigma,A)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{542}(\\sigma,B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{542}(\\sigma,A\\to B)=\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{542}(\\sigma,A)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{542}(\\sigma,B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{542}(\\sigma,\\Box A)=\\Box\\operatorname{Sub}_{542}(\\sigma,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{542}(\\sigma,\\Box A)=\\Box\\operatorname{Sub}_{542}(\\sigma,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-GL内层公理族\">4. GL内层公理族</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{542}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{542}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{542}\n=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{542}\n=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{542}\n=\n\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{542}\n=\n\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{542}=\\{\\neg\\bot\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{542}=\\{\\neg\\bot\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{542}\n=\n\\{\\Box(A\\to B)\\to(\\Box A\\to\\Box B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{542}\n=\n\\{\\Box(A\\to B)\\to(\\Box A\\to\\Box B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{542}\n=\n\\{\\Box A\\to\\Box\\Box A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{542}\n=\n\\{\\Box A\\to\\Box\\Box A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{L}^{542}\n=\n\\{\\Box(\\Box A\\to A)\\to\\Box A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{L}^{542}\n=\n\\{\\Box(\\Box A\\to A)\\to\\Box A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{GL}^{542}=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{542}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{542}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{542}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{542}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{542}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{542}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{L}^{542}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{GL}^{542}=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{542}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{542}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{542}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{542}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{542}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{542}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{L}^{542}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-内层规则、有限证明及定理集\">5. 内层规则、有限证明及定理集</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{542}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{542}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,GL}^{542}=\\{((A),\\Box A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,GL}^{542}=\\{((A),\\Box A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\quad A\\to B}{B}\\ (MP),\\qquad\\frac{A}{\\Box A}\\ (Nec_{GL}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\quad A\\to B}{B}\\ (MP),\\qquad\\frac{A}{\\Box A}\\ (Nec_{GL}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{GLProof}_{542}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\mathsf{GLProof}_{542}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 为所有非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\xi=(B_0,\\ldots,B_{k-1})\">\\(\\xi=(B_0,\\ldots,B_{k-1})\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k&gt;0\">\\(k&gt;0\\)</span>，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;k\">\\(i&lt;k\\)</span> 至少满足以下一个条件：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{GL}^{542}\">\\(B_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{GL}^{542}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,l&lt;i\">\\(j,l&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((B_j,B_l),B_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{542}\">\\(((B_j,B_l),B_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{542}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((B_j),B_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,GL}^{542}\">\\(((B_j),B_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,GL}^{542}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>内层没有假设行。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{glast}_{542}(\\xi)=B_{k-1},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{GLThm}_{542}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}:\\exists\\xi\\in\\mathsf{GLProof}_{542}\\ (\\operatorname{glast}_{542}(\\xi)=A)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{glast}_{542}(\\xi)=B_{k-1},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{GLThm}_{542}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}:\\exists\\xi\\in\\mathsf{GLProof}_{542}\\ (\\operatorname{glast}_{542}(\\xi)=A)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-外层反射、公理与规则\">6. 外层反射、公理与规则</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Ref}^{542}=\\{\\Box A\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{542}=\\mathsf{GLThm}_{542}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Ref}^{542}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Ref}^{542}=\\{\\Box A\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{542}=\\mathsf{GLThm}_{542}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Ref}^{542}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>外层规则关系为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{542}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{542}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{542}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{542}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Nec_{GL}\">\\(Nec_{GL}\\)</span> 只在内层 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\xi\">\\(\\xi\\)</span> 中使用，外层没有必然化分支。</p>\n<h1 id=\"7.-外层有限证明对象\">7. 外层有限证明对象</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Reason}_{542}\">\\(\\mathsf{Reason}_{542}\\)</span> 为以下四个带不同首标签的集合之并：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{(\\mathsf{hyp},B):B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\\},\\quad\n\\{(\\mathsf{gl},\\xi):\\xi\\in\\mathsf{GLProof}_{542}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{(\\mathsf{hyp},B):B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\\},\\quad\n\\{(\\mathsf{gl},\\xi):\\xi\\in\\mathsf{GLProof}_{542}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{(\\mathsf{ref},B):B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\\},\\quad\n\\{(\\mathsf{mp},j,l):j,l\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{(\\mathsf{ref},B):B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\\},\\quad\n\\{(\\mathsf{mp},j,l):j,l\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{542}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{542}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 是所有非空有限序列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i,r_i))_{i&lt;m},\\quad m&gt;0,\\quad\n\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma),\\quad A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542},\\quad r_i\\in\\mathsf{Reason}_{542},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i,r_i))_{i&lt;m},\\quad m&gt;0,\\quad\n\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma),\\quad A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542},\\quad r_i\\in\\mathsf{Reason}_{542},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span> 满足其标签对应的一种条件：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r_i=(\\mathsf{hyp},B)\">\\(r_i=(\\mathsf{hyp},B)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=B\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i=B\\in\\Gamma\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{B\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{B\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r_i=(\\mathsf{gl},\\xi)\">\\(r_i=(\\mathsf{gl},\\xi)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\xi\\in\\mathsf{GLProof}_{542}\">\\(\\xi\\in\\mathsf{GLProof}_{542}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=\\operatorname{glast}_{542}(\\xi)\">\\(A_i=\\operatorname{glast}_{542}(\\xi)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r_i=(\\mathsf{ref},B)\">\\(r_i=(\\mathsf{ref},B)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=\\Box B\\to B\">\\(A_i=\\Box B\\to B\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r_i=(\\mathsf{mp},j,l)\">\\(r_i=(\\mathsf{mp},j,l)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,l&lt;i\">\\(j,l&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_l),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{542}\">\\(((A_j,A_l),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{542}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_l\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_l\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{542}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1})\">\\(\\operatorname{last}_{542}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1})\\)</span>。GL行携带实际有限内层证明，不能由未核验的定理标签代替。</p>\n<h1 id=\"8.-可证性与证书\">8. 可证性与证书</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{542}A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\\land A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\\land\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{542}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ (\\operatorname{last}_{542}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{542}A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\\land A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\\land\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{542}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ (\\operatorname{last}_{542}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{542}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{542}A\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{542}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{542}A\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SolCert}_{542}=\\{(A,\\pi):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542},\\ \\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{542}(\\varnothing),\\ \\operatorname{last}_{542}(\\pi)=(\\varnothing,A)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SolCert}_{542}=\\{(A,\\pi):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542},\\ \\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{542}(\\varnothing),\\ \\operatorname{last}_{542}(\\pi)=(\\varnothing,A)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-目标区分与范围\">9. 目标区分与范围</h1>\n<p>反射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box A\\to A\">\\(\\Box A\\to A\\)</span> 有一行外层证书 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\varnothing,\\Box A\\to A,(\\mathsf{ref},A)))\">\\(((\\varnothing,\\Box A\\to A,(\\mathsf{ref},A)))\\)</span>。外层没有从该行推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box(\\Box A\\to A)\">\\(\\Box(\\Box A\\to A)\\)</span> 的必然化规则，内层也没有反射公理。内外证明载体的这一区分构成本条目与 GL 的形式增量；纯代码语言的同构复制不充当算术实现。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-整个句法形式系统\">10. 整个句法形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{Solovay}_{542}=\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{542},\\mathsf{Frm}_{542},\\operatorname{PV}_{542},\\operatorname{BV}_{542},\\equiv_{\\alpha,542},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{542},\\operatorname{Sub}_{542},\\mathsf{Ax}_{GL}^{542},\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{542},\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,GL}^{542},\n\\mathsf{GLProof}_{542},\\operatorname{glast}_{542},\\mathsf{GLThm}_{542},\\mathsf{Ax}_{Ref}^{542},\\mathsf{Ax}_{542},\\mathsf{Rule}_{542},\n\\mathsf{Reason}_{542},\\mathsf{Proof}_{542},\\operatorname{last}_{542},\\vdash_{542},\\mathsf{Thm}_{542},\\operatorname{SolCert}_{542}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{Solovay}_{542}=\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{542},\\mathsf{Frm}_{542},\\operatorname{PV}_{542},\\operatorname{BV}_{542},\\equiv_{\\alpha,542},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{542},\\operatorname{Sub}_{542},\\mathsf{Ax}_{GL}^{542},\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{542},\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,GL}^{542},\n\\mathsf{GLProof}_{542},\\operatorname{glast}_{542},\\mathsf{GLThm}_{542},\\mathsf{Ax}_{Ref}^{542},\\mathsf{Ax}_{542},\\mathsf{Rule}_{542},\n\\mathsf{Reason}_{542},\\mathsf{Proof}_{542},\\operatorname{last}_{542},\\vdash_{542},\\mathsf{Thm}_{542},\\operatorname{SolCert}_{542}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含 S/GLS 的模态句法、结构替换、内外两层有限证明、公理、规则和可证性；不含算术句子编码、算术满足、算术证明谓词或可靠性与完备性证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-原始符号与版本范围","text":"1. 原始符号与版本范围","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元与替换","text":"3. 自由变元与替换","level":1},{"id":"4.-GL内层公理族","text":"4. GL内层公理族","level":1},{"id":"5.-内层规则、有限证明及定理集","text":"5. 内层规则、有限证明及定理集","level":1},{"id":"6.-外层反射、公理与规则","text":"6. 外层反射、公理与规则","level":1},{"id":"7.-外层有限证明对象","text":"7. 外层有限证明对象","level":1},{"id":"8.-可证性与证书","text":"8. 可证性与证书","level":1},{"id":"9.-目标区分与范围","text":"9. 目标区分与范围","level":1},{"id":"10.-整个句法形式系统","text":"10. 整个句法形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\quad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:k\\to X\\ (Y=\\{e(i):i<k\\})\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{542}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{box}.","display":true},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{542}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{box}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}","display":false},{"tex":"p,\\bot,\\neg A,A\\to B,\\Box A","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PV}_{542}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{542})","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PV}_{542}(p)=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{542}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{542}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{542}(A),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PV}_{542}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{542}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{542}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{542}(\\Box A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{542}(A)","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BV}_{542}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{542})","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BV}_{542}(A)=\\varnothing,\n\\qquad\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,542}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Subst}_{542}\n=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{542}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}:\n\\{p:\\sigma(p)\\ne p\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{542})\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}_{542}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{542}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}_{542}(\\sigma,p)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{542}(\\sigma,\\bot)=\\bot,","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}_{542}(\\sigma,\\neg A)=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}_{542}(\\sigma,A),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}_{542}(\\sigma,A\\to B)=\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{542}(\\sigma,A)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{542}(\\sigma,B),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}_{542}(\\sigma,\\Box A)=\\Box\\operatorname{Sub}_{542}(\\sigma,A).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{542}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{542}\n=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{542}\n=\n\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{542}=\\{\\neg\\bot\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{542}\n=\n\\{\\Box(A\\to B)\\to(\\Box A\\to\\Box B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{542}\n=\n\\{\\Box A\\to\\Box\\Box A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ax}_{L}^{542}\n=\n\\{\\Box(\\Box A\\to A)\\to\\Box A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ax}_{GL}^{542}=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{542}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{542}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{542}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{542}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{542}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{542}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{L}^{542}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{542}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,GL}^{542}=\\{((A),\\Box A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\frac{A\\quad A\\to B}{B}\\ (MP),\\qquad\\frac{A}{\\Box A}\\ (Nec_{GL}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{GLProof}_{542}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{542}^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\xi=(B_0,\\ldots,B_{k-1})","display":false},{"tex":"k>0","display":false},{"tex":"i<k","display":false},{"tex":"B_i\